      "label": "Interceptor (interceptBefore / interceptAfter)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "rationale": "Compiles into beforeHandle/afterHandle; interceptBefore cannot short-circuit and returning undefined from interceptAfter leaves the handler result unchanged.",
